      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Hello! I'd be happy to help you draft that performance review. It's a delicate balance, but you can certainly praise their exceptional client retention while firmly addressing the punctuality issue.\n\nHere is a draft you can use, which is structured to highlight their achievements first, then transition smoothly to the attendance concerns, and finally outline the path forward.\n\n***\n\n**Subject:** Performance Review: [Employee Name] – Q4 2023\n\n**Dear [Employee Name],**\n\nI wanted to take a moment to formally recognize your outstanding performance this year, particularly regarding our top-tier accounts. Your ability to secure and maintain these high-value relationships has been nothing short of remarkable. In fact, your client retention metrics for these accounts have exceeded all targets by a significant margin. It is rare to see such dedication and strategic foresight, and your success in this area has directly contributed to our overall revenue stability.\n\nHowever, while your external results are stellar, there is a critical area where we need to align our internal operations: your attendance at morning stand-ups. As you know, these sessions are vital for cross-functional alignment and team cohesion. The frequency with which you have missed the start of these meetings has begun to create a ripple",
      "source": "target",
